00:33:13.942 --> 00:33:15.777
And instead of going
through drawing it all,

00:33:15.777 --> 00:33:17.446
I'll save myself a
few minutes here.

00:33:17.446 --> 00:33:18.780
I'll show it to you.

00:33:18.780 --> 00:33:19.281
All right.

00:33:19.281 --> 00:33:21.817
So there is that energy scale.

00:33:21.817 --> 00:33:23.552
And oh, they're
