00:33:35.197 --> 00:33:38.734
So this is going to
be a sigma p orbital.

00:33:38.734 --> 00:33:40.268
This is a sigma p orbital.

00:33:40.268 --> 00:33:41.203
And you can see that.

00:33:41.203 --> 00:33:43.271
And there's a sigma star.

00:33:43.271 --> 00:33:43.872
Right.

00:33:43.872 --> 00:33:44.673
Good.

00:33:44.673 --> 00:33:47.209
Now, if we go to that,
